fabula: a Cucumber/Gherkin test runner
usage: <binary> [<file>.feature | <file>.feature:LINE... | <dir>]... [options]

options:
  -h, --help                   print this help and exit
  -q, --quiet                  print only errors and the summary
  -v, --verbose                print extra detail as a scenario runs
  -d, --dry-run                check steps are defined; run none of them
  -c, --continue-on-failure    keep running a scenario's steps after one fails
  -t, --tags <EXPRESSION>      run only scenarios the tag expression selects
  -n, --name <PATTERN>         run only scenarios whose name matches; ':' separates
                               several patterns, '*' and '?' wildcard
  --exclude-file <SUFFIX>      skip a discovered file whose path ends in SUFFIX
  --report-json [FILE]         write a JSON report to FILE, or to stdout
